The runtime implementation and DFlash2 drafter are upstream work. This
repository contributes a pinned A100 deployment overlay, A100 40/80 GB
measurements, the fixed 8 GiB pool correction for the tested workload, and an
RVN-specific W4A16 derivative/qualification path.

